          "text": "En otyeko poŋogi ki kwiri me tiyo kwa tic ducu me diro, ki me roto cal tic manyen me tic diro, ki me dero boŋo ki uci ma bulu, ki ma lamar lamar, ki makwar, ki boŋo camanini ma giwiyo maberre, ki me cweyo boŋo, ki me tiyo kwa t ic ducu, ki me roto cal manyen me tic diro mapatpat.",
